Z||000000||Alex4mula||12-21-2001||09:14 AM||||Lok here: <A HREF="http://www.ofoto.com/I.jsp?m=65184578203&n=736650429" TARGET=_blank>http://www.ofoto.com/I.jsp?m=65184578203&n=736650429</A> <P>Just wanted to share my latest results. Got these GT trumpet tips in very poor condition but a little buffing and paint gave me these results. Also they were pre 88 so I had to cut the elbow of a Formula tip and re-weld it for the proper alignment. Sail panels were painted and new panel/crest installed. The carper is from ACC (dove gray) and will soon go into the car. Car is an 88 Formula, which got the aero package. Will keep the round trims and is currently being painted Lexus Solar yellow. Next week should be ready  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    Alex4mula<BR>:) Red-Original Owner & White-1/94 with PM (:||||reg||10
